6 at `f8b90a5` (base `main` `b3a5031`, MERGEABLE, all six commits GPG-good, no tags, no leftover probe branches), and commit the curator `LOGBOOK.md` change. No `commit_ack` supplied — reviewer archetype. All three of my worktrees under `/tmp` are removed; no repository file was modified.\n\nNon-blocking: a symlinked home is still adopted un-provisioned (deliberate, matches baseline, fails closed later on Windows); the cost test's nested fixtures are sound but subtle. The elevated-shell Administrators-owned Windows home remains an open **product decision** and was correctly kept out of this round.","ttft_ms":1879,"ttft_stream_ms":1430,"time_to_request_ms":33,"type":"result","duration_ms":914781,"uuid":"be95023e-69b9-4ca0-b58e-10a6a45c40b2"}
